---
// 文档站入口 — 浅色纸卡，不做第二个强调色块（ChatCta 是页面唯一的墨绿色块）
// 具体入口页列表为便捷跳转，主入口是右上角的 docs.loopv.net
---

<section class="px-5 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-7 shadow-soft sm:p-10">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
        <div class="max-w-prose">
          <p class="font-mono text-[13px] text-accent">03 — 文档</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">LoopV 文档</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
            docs.loopv.net 汇集了项目里的说明文档——README、项目上下文、开发日志、
            聊天室操作手册都有，想了解这个站是怎么搭的、聊天室怎么用，来这边翻。
            页面由仓库里的 Markdown 直接生成，源文件更新后重新构建即是新内容。
          </p>
        </div>

        <a
          href="https://docs.loopv.net"
          class="group inline-flex flex-shrink-0 items-center gap-2 self-start rounded-lg border border-line bg-paper px-4 py-2 font-mono text-sm text-ink-muted transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent"
        >
          docs.loopv.net
          <span class="transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- 常用文档直达 -->
      <ul class="mt-8 border-t border-line">
        {[
          { href: "https://docs.loopv.net/readme", name: "README.md", desc: "项目总览与快速开始" },
          { href: "https://docs.loopv.net/context", name: "CONTEXT.md", desc: "架构与关键设计决策" },
          { href: "https://docs.loopv.net/changelog", name: "CHANGELOG.md", desc: "开发日志与迭代记录" },
          { href: "https://docs.loopv.net/chat-manual", name: "chat-manual.md", desc: "聊天室使用说明" },
        ].map((item) => (
          <li>
            <a
              href={item.href}
              class="group flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 py-3.5 transition-colors"
            >
              <span class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
                <span class="w-28 flex-shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-ink-faint">{item.name}</span>
                <span class="text-sm text-ink-muted transition-colors group-hover:text-accent">
                  {item.desc}
                </span>
              </span>
              <span
                class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-faint transition-all duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-accent"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >→</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
